    "Reminders are set on this device: check-in opens a day before, a summary at 7:00 on the morning of the flight, and a nudge to leave, timed from where you are when you allow your location, else 3 hours before an international flight or 2 before a domestic one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
