    "Soma Flight Passport, all flight stats": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Passeport Soma Flight, toutes les stats de vol"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Soma Flight aims to have you at the gate when boarding starts. Whether you check bags isn't known, so the bag drop always counts. The drive and the queue update each time you open the flight, the walk when the gate is announced.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soma Flight vise à te mettre à la porte quand l'embarquement commence. On ne sait pas si tu enregistres des bagages, donc le dépôt des bagages compte toujours. Le trajet et la file se mettent à jour à chaque ouverture du vol, la marche quand la porte est annoncée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Soma Flight can only add events to your calendar. To find flights in it, allow full access in Settings > Privacy > Calendars.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soma Flight peut seulement ajouter des événements à ton calendrier. Pour y trouver des vols, autorise l'accès complet dans Réglages > Confidentialité > Calendriers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Soma Flight can't read this. Share the airline's confirmation email or its PDF itinerary.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soma Flight ne peut pas lire ceci. Partage l'e-mail de confirmation de la compagnie ou son itinéraire PDF."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Soma Flight can't read your calendar. To find flights in it, allow full access in Settings > Privacy > Calendars.": {
